        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Black Star Cleaning Services came today to my house for the first time and did a thorough job, not missing a beat and being detail oriented. They did everything I expected and did it meticulously. They are proud of their work and it shows! I wholeheartedly recommend them! THANK YOU to both of you and look forward to seeing you again in a few weeks.",
