        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102144917338464311819/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIeHhaoOMmTUSDghwinrbPVZeaoTNOM5rLK7vIjr1-SYb1FrA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Friendly and professional team. Great communication. They went above and beyond. The team came to clean up the leaves in my backyard. There is not 1 leaf left on the ground! I will definitely be using Black Star Cleaning Service again. Would recommend!",
        "time": 1636940469,
        "translated": false
