        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Unreliable and unprofessional. We scheduled a time by email (a time they proposed) and I sent them my phone number 3 days in advance to arrange the details. They never called (so obviously did not show up) and instead sent an email 2.5 hours before the scheduled time to ask for the address, which I didn’t see until later. Instead of calling the number I provided to ask, they chose to just not come and never answered my email that I responded to when I saw it.",
